onal","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0141","start":141,"end":142,"surface":"嶠","kind":"person","person_id":"3fc_362_06e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0155","start":155,"end":157,"surface":"王戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0171","start":171,"end":172,"surface":"戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0182","start":182,"end":183,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":76,"last_line":76,"revision_id":2618531},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-wangrong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015","text":"毌丘儉作亂，景帝自出征之，百官祖送於城東，袤疾病不任會。帝謂中領軍王肅曰：「唯不見鄭光祿為恨。」肅以語袤，袤自輿追帝，及於近道。帝笑曰：「故知侯生必來也。」遂與袤共載，曰：「計將何先？」袤曰：「昔與儉俱為台郎，特所知悉。其人好謀而不達事情，自昔建勳幽州，志望無限。文欽勇而無算。今大軍出其不意，江、淮之卒銳而不能固，深溝高壘以挫其氣，此亞夫之長也。」帝稱善。轉太常。高貴鄉公議立明堂辟雍，精選博士，袤舉劉毅、劉寔、程咸、庾峻，後並至公輔大位。及常道鄉公立，與議定策，進封安城鄉侯，邑千戶。景元初，疾病失明，屢乞骸骨，不許。拜光祿大夫。五等初建，封密陵伯。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"毌丘儉","kind":"person","person_id":"b61_784_cbb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAH","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextua